                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d113fc7a-c0a9-3a73-b424-158e03264d3d",
                        "entry_id": "2ceaad41-20f0-3667-9518-403884d45672",
                        "glosses": [
                            "pisemna praca szkolna, w której uczeń ma uzasadnić jakąś tezę"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5330c2cd-7db3-4b9a-82de-7b7677711fa8",
                                "sense_id": "d113fc7a-c0a9-3a73-b424-158e03264d3d",
                                "text": "Rozprawka jest zasadą szkolnego egzaminu."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5e30c1bd-6dec-469d-9945-eee889f0b386",
                        "source_entry_id": "2ceaad41-20f0-3667-9518-403884d45672",
                        "source_sense_id": "d113fc7a-c0a9-3a73-b424-158e03264d3d",
                        "target_lang_word": "essay",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "essay",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5bd9b8cd-a871-3f47-b98b-2b591d1ddc72",
                                        "entry_id": "e87a60cd-8fea-3f7d-864a-73af315c57e5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A written composition of moderate length, exploring a particular issue or subject."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "951f5406-823c-403c-8d41-9ff1f3e6b85d",
                                                "sense_id": "5bd9b8cd-a871-3f47-b98b-2b591d1ddc72",
                                                "text": "In his first book since the 2008 essay collection Natural Acts: A Sidelong View of Science and Nature, David Quammen looks at the natural world from yet another angle: the search for the next human pandemic, what epidemiologists call “the next big one.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d05dcdd5-27f2-32d5-b8dc-c175cf8e0762",
                                        "entry_id": "e87a60cd-8fea-3f7d-864a-73af315c57e5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A test, experiment; an assay."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fe011b6c-c9b5-3c60-beb9-37cbecad23ce",
                                        "entry_id": "e87a60cd-8fea-3f7d-864a-73af315c57e5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An attempt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "170063ac-5fbb-4243-aa65-945c9ad9d4a4",
                                                "sense_id": "fe011b6c-c9b5-3c60-beb9-37cbecad23ce",
                                                "text": "My first essay at getting employment was fruitless; but after no small number of mortifying rebuffs from various parties to whom I applied for assistance, I was at last rewarded by a comparative success."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2202ebe0-49a2-4752-b175-121ad2b817d6",
                                                "sense_id": "fe011b6c-c9b5-3c60-beb9-37cbecad23ce",
                                                "text": "This was Lee's first essay in the kind of offensive-defensive strategy that was to become his hallmark."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8993071c-d925-3a45-af65-8addf409f367",
                                        "entry_id": "e87a60cd-8fea-3f7d-864a-73af315c57e5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A proposed design for a postage stamp or a banknote."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "essay",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2a257c6e-a37e-34c8-aad1-2566b8d16149",
                                        "entry_id": "80459308-695a-396a-8795-8de557b3359b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To attempt or try."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12c2ea68-cd18-491e-a69f-7768f3b8e6b2",
                                                "sense_id": "2a257c6e-a37e-34c8-aad1-2566b8d16149",
                                                "text": "Shall we essay a walk on the promenade?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10d70805-db02-424a-9cf1-aeac72b18a86",
                                                "sense_id": "2a257c6e-a37e-34c8-aad1-2566b8d16149",
                                                "text": "He retraced his steps to the front gate, which he essayed to open."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68254b6a-b495-4d11-aa62-1094b3bf2e8f",
                                                "sense_id": "2a257c6e-a37e-34c8-aad1-2566b8d16149",
                                                "text": "The train took the slow to branch spur at the north end at a not much slower speed, then essayed the short sharply curved climb with a terrific roar, smoke rising straight from the chimney to a height of some 60 ft., the long train twisting and curling behind."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "197c64f7-e2aa-4ea2-9f25-25e9d53e93f0",
                                                "sense_id": "2a257c6e-a37e-34c8-aad1-2566b8d16149",
                                                "text": "There was the counter, there was the bulletin board, above her the dull sound of music being played over headphones. Something jaunty. She liked the beat. Then the sound of a chair being pushed back, and someone humming as they walked away from her, and she darted up to plunge the bayonet into their kidneys from behind. A followup stroke through the back of the neck, and the second soldier was down. She didn't even stop to see if it was a man or a woman, young or old. There were further hurdles to essay before she reached her destination."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "378f6121-4a98-3ed5-91e1-6414e534b6c3",
                                        "entry_id": "80459308-695a-396a-8795-8de557b3359b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move forth, as into battle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
